        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Lost Child is a walking simulator and horror game with survival elements.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a Nightmare With No Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Andrey wakes up in an endless maze of corridors.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They seem vaguely familiar, but his memory is wiped, and reality distorts with every step. Voices from the darkness, children's screams, sinister shadows — what is this? Hallucinations, memories, or someone's cruel experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.poster.avif?t=1785577439\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.webm?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.mp4?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement changes the environment. Behind closed doors lies a truth Andrey doesn’t want to remember. But you can't run from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to remember what can’t be forgotten?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.poster.avif?t=1785577439\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.webm?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.mp4?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror with a deep narrative</strong> – Uncover a dark mystery by piecing together fragments of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shifting world</strong> – The corridors have a life of their own, twisting and adapting to the protagonist's fears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>References to real events</strong> – Subtle details that will make you think twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> – Whispers behind your back, echoes of footsteps, and haunting noises pull you deeper into the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> – Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, the horror feels closer than ever before</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Lost Child is a walking simulator and horror game with survival elements.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a Nightmare With No Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Andrey wakes up in an endless maze of corridors.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They seem vaguely familiar, but his memory is wiped, and reality distorts with every step. Voices from the darkness, children's screams, sinister shadows — what is this? Hallucinations, memories, or someone's cruel experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.poster.avif?t=1785577439\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.webm?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.mp4?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement changes the environment. Behind closed doors lies a truth Andrey doesn’t want to remember. But you can't run from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to remember what can’t be forgotten?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.poster.avif?t=1785577439\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.webm?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.mp4?t=1785577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror with a deep narrative</strong> – Uncover a dark mystery by piecing together fragments of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shifting world</strong> – The corridors have a life of their own, twisting and adapting to the protagonist's fears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>References to real events</strong> – Subtle details that will make you think twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> – Whispers behind your back, echoes of footsteps, and haunting noises pull you deeper into the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> – Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, the horror feels closer than ever before</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Are You Lost? Wander endless corridors where shifting environments, sinister voices, and echoes of real events create a chilling atmosphere. Andrey doesn’t remember who he was, but the walls know the truth. It’s time to remember everything.",
